   "title": "Write with i",
   "text": "\\[\\begin{aligned}&(-1)^{3/2}=\\left((-1)^{1/2}\\right)^{3}=i^{3}=-i\\\\[5pt]&\\dfrac{2}{(-1)^{3/2}}=\\dfrac{2}{-i}\\end{aligned}\\]",
