   "title": "Multiply by i",
   "text": "\\[\\begin{aligned}&\\text{Multiply top and bottom by $i$.}\\\\[5pt]&\\dfrac{2}{-i}=\\dfrac{2\\cdot i}{-i\\cdot i}=\\dfrac{2i}{-i^{2}}\\end{aligned}\\]",
   "actions": [
